xact propagation (98-154s). gate=kept; trigger=none; reason=untested idea-stage hypothesis applying recorded cycle-9 next actions (change Walker plane/phasing geometry; pair scheduler with diverse orbit geometries/constructive growth), no new evaluation evidence, so no distilled-conclusion update is warranted.\n- evidence: best manifest cycle-9 window-flexible 77.0263 correct=true total 59, 6h fleets 17/17, max_solve_s=28.03; cycle-9 window-time and cycle-8 union-pool best 77.4211 total 58 (13/16/16/13); cycles 4/6/7 plateau total 59; distilled conclusions direct changing Walker plane/phasing geometry for 6h while retaining seed-first slew-audited cached pipeline and forbid further window-time tuning.\n- key_rubrics: combined_score_beats_best (metric), all_missions_feasible_including_tight (metric), total_fleet_at_most_55 (metric), tight_six_hour_fleets_at_most_15 (metric), valid_plan_no_violations (metric), runtime_at_most_60s (metric), seed_first_slew_audited_fallback_retained (implementation), geometry_diverse_constructive_growth (implementation), cached_fast_only_deadline_enforced_search (implementation), generalizes_without_hardcoding (implementation)\n- next_action: Implement solve() per idea_bundle.json on top of the best-manifest program; test a tight 20-satellite 6h mission first for early verified seed, grown fleet at most 15 with slew audit passing, then an 8h mission, validate per-case n_satellites/n_targets_missing/worst_gap_h/n_actions and max_solve_s, then run full evaluation once; never return empty actions.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":14,"totalLines":14,"truncated":false}},"title":"results/revisit/opencode/20261030_163231/investigation/worker_02/ideas/10_geometry_diverse_constructive_growth_for_six_hour_revisit_compression/memory.md","time":{"start":1793383417522,"end":1793383417949}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_01a18dfb42af7678a681fc3d3d0c15ec"}},"id":"prt_18dfb4671001bhSp1bPQdsq4gP","sessionID":"ses_e72053da9ffeY5Vp446Zu901pu","messageID":"msg