_constellation_minimization_attempt_01\", \"idea_id\": \"cycle_01_targeted_coverage_greedy_constellation_minimization\", \"program_id\": \"program_1\", \"metrics\": {\"combined_score\": 45.131578947368425, \"correct\": false}}\n5: {\"timestamp\": \"2026-10-30T17:10:00Z\", \"step\": \"idea\", \"scope\": \"idea\", \"summary\": \"Cycle 2 idea cycle_02_runtime_first_lean_constellation_with_guaranteed_fallback_return: cap-fallback-first best-so-far return, lean pruned pool (<=~40 generated, <=~16 retained), cached fast-propagation opportunity/battery windows reused for growth/repair/removal, deadline checks in every costly loop, deadline/slack scheduling, removal only while ample budget remains. gate=kept; trigger=none; reason=untested hypothesis applying existing distilled conclusion, no new evaluation evidence.\", \"evidence\": \"cycle-1 combined_score=45.1316 correct=false; feasible 90.0 (6/16) and 90.526 (7/20) on 8h missions but 0 actions on one tighter case and 209.02s timeout on another; conclusions.md directs runtime-first lean variant with caching and early best-verified return.\", \"next_action\": \"Implement solve() per idea_bundle.json; test tight 6h mission first, validate per_case n_satellites/n_targets_missing/worst_gap_h, then full evaluation; never return empty actions.\", \"idea_id\": \"cycle_02_runtime_first_lean_constellation_with_guaranteed_fallback_return\", \"rubrics\": [{\"id\": \"combined_score_above_70\", \"type\": \"metric\"}, {\"id\": \"all_missions_feasible_including_tight\", \"type\": \"metric\"}, {\"id\": \"runtime_well_within_limit\", \"type\": \"metric\"}, {\"id\": \"satellite_reduction_retained\", \"type\": \"metric\"}, {\"id\": \"never_empty_best_so_far_return\", \"type\": \"implementation\"}, {\"id\": \"lean_cached_propagation\", \"type\": \"implementation\"}, {\"id\": \"deadline_aware_constrained_scheduler\", \"type\": \"implementation\"}, {\"id\": \"generalizes_to_sealed_missions\", \"type\": \"implementation\"}], \"tags\": [\"cycle_